# Staging point for the WALINET weights that get baked into the image.
#
# The payloads are about 1 GB per model and must never be committed. Ignore
# everything dropped in here, but keep the directory itself and its
# documentation tracked: a fresh clone has to be able to build, and the
# Dockerfile reads this directory whether or not anything was staged.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
